% Non-coding computer time: work / study / brain rot; what stood out.
\p{There is no non-coding computer time because arbtt is a very lightweight program with no synchronization across devices. Qualitatively, I am jumping around too much again. I do not know if arbtt can properly capture this, but I need to be more disciplined with the pomodoro method. Specifically, choosing something to work on and not diverging \strong{for anything} until the timer has ended.}
